<title>UK: WORLD BANK SETS 15 BLN DRACHMA 5-YR STEP-DOWN BOND.</title>
<headline>WORLD BANK SETS 15 BLN DRACHMA 5-YR STEP-DOWN BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN Amro Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    15 BLN GRD    COUPON    **11.375   MATURITY    09.SEP.02</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-DOWN     ISS PRICE  101.625   PAY DATE    09.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REC REOFF  99.95     LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> NOTES    **FOR FIRST YEAR THEN STEPS-DOWN TO 8.0 PCT</p>
</text>
